  "description": "790+ embedded .whfmt definitions (782 formats + 10 grammars) for automatic file format detection AND syntax highlighting. Covers 27 binary categories (Archives, Audio, Images, Game, ROMs, Executables, Disk, Crypto...) plus 57 language grammars (C#, Python, JS/TS, Go, Rust, Java, Kotlin, Swift, YAML, TOML, Markdown, Dockerfile, HCL, Nginx, WAT, and more). whfmt schema v2.4: formatId, SyntaxDefinition, group/header/data blocks, sentinel scanning, cross-format imports. Cross-platform net8.0. Utility layer: FormatFileAnalyzer, FormatMatcher (scored confidence), CatalogQuery (fluent), FormatMetadataExtensions (forensic/AI/assertions), FormatSummaryBuilder.",
